@startuml sample_games_flow
title create_samples --sample_games 流程

autonumber

participant "User" as U
participant "create_samples" as CS
participant "AIGameManager" as AGM
participant "is_sample_game" as ISG
participant "should_keep_game" as SKG
participant "SampleCreator" as SC

== --sample_games 模式 ==

U -> CS: --sample_games N
CS -> CS: parse_args()\n互斥校验(--games vs --sample_games)
CS -> CS: 加载model, 创建engine, 创建recorder

loop sample_count < target
    CS -> AGM: _play_single_game(engine, engine, recorder, game_num, temp_config)
    AGM --> CS: SingleGameResult(winner, temp_side_this_game)
    CS -> ISG: is_sample_game(result_dict)
    ISG -> SKG: should_keep_game(result_dict)
    SKG --> ISG: True / False
    ISG --> CS: winner∈{1,2} 且 SKG=True → True\n否则 → False
    CS -> CS: sample_count++ (if True)\n百分比跨越10%整数倍 → print_sample_progress()
end

CS -> SC: create_from_round_dir(round_dir, record_filter=should_keep_game)
SC --> CS: samples
CS -> CS: 写入输出文件

== Ctrl+C 中断场景 ==

U -> CS: Ctrl+C
CS -> CS: catch KeyboardInterrupt
CS -> CS: 打印中断统计\n(sample_count/target, total_games)
CS -> SC: create_from_round_dir(round_dir, record_filter=should_keep_game)
SC --> CS: partial samples
CS -> CS: 写入部分样本到输出文件\n统计输出基于已有results正常计算

@enduml